{"seq":2,"slug":"database-bigdata-platforms","title":"数据库与大数据平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/database-bigdata-platforms","wordCount":1011,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据库与大数据平台\">数据库与大数据平台</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>数字经济运行产生的海量数据需要高效的存储、查询和计算基础设施支撑。从传统关系型数据库到分布式大数据平台，技术选型直接影响业务系统的性能、成本和可扩展性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关系型数据库与-sql\">关系型数据库与 SQL</h3><p>关系型数据库以表格形式组织数据，通过 SQL 实现声明式查询。ACID 特性保证事务的可靠性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原子性（Atomicity）</strong>：事务要么全部执行，要么全部回滚</li>\n<li><strong>一致性（Consistency）</strong>：事务前后数据库满足完整性约束</li>\n<li><strong>隔离性（Isolation）</strong>：并发事务互不干扰</li>\n<li><strong>持久性（Durability）</strong>：提交的事务永久生效</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心 SQL 操作示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 电商场景：统计各品类月度 GMV&#10;SELECT category,&#10;       DATE_TRUNC(&#39;month&#39;, order_date) AS month,&#10;       SUM(amount) AS gmv,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS buyers&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE order_date &gt;= &#39;2026-01-01&#39;&#10;GROUP BY category, month&#10;HAVING SUM(amount) &gt; 100000&#10;ORDER BY gmv DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 电商场景：统计各品类月度 GMV</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'month'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gmv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buyers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">month</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gmv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"索引与查询优化\">索引与查询优化</h3><p>B+ 树索引是关系型数据库最常用的索引结构。对于包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 条记录的表，B+ 树查询的时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>m</mi></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_m n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 为树的阶数（通常 100-500）。</p>\n<p>查询优化的关键策略：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>避免全表扫描——为 WHERE 条件列建立索引</li>\n<li>覆盖索引——将查询所需列全部包含在索引中</li>\n<li>避免索引失效——不在索引列上使用函数或隐式类型转换</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"nosql-数据库\">NoSQL 数据库</h3><p>非关系型数据库为不同数据模型提供专用解决方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>键值存储</td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>缓存、会话管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档数据库</td>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>半结构化数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列族存储</td>\n<td>HBase</td>\n<td>海量稀疏数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图数据库</td>\n<td>Neo4j</td>\n<td>社交网络、知识图谱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CAP 定理指出分布式系统无法同时满足一致性（C）、可用性（A）和分区容错性（P），必须在三者中取舍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hadoop-生态系统\">Hadoop 生态系统</h3><p>Hadoop 以 HDFS 分布式文件系统和 MapReduce 计算框架为核心，构建了完整的大数据处理生态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;数据源&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;HDFS 分布式存储&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;MapReduce/Spark 计算&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Hive 数据仓库&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;BI 分析与可视化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;HBase 实时查询&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; G[&quot;Kafka 消息队列&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;Flink 流处理&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"数据源\"] --&gt; B[\"HDFS 分布式存储\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"MapReduce/Spark 计算\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Hive 数据仓库\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"BI 分析与可视化\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"HBase 实时查询\"]\n    A --&gt; G[\"Kafka 消息队列\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"Flink 流处理\"]</pre><p>HDFS 将文件拆分为固定大小的 Block（默认 128MB），分散存储在集群节点上，通过三副本策略保证数据可靠性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"apache-spark\">Apache Spark</h3><p>Spark 通过内存计算和 DAG 执行引擎，比 MapReduce 快 10-100 倍。其核心抽象 RDD（弹性分布式数据集）支持惰性求值和血统恢复：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>执行时间</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mtext>数据量</mtext><mrow><mtext>节点数</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>单节点吞吐</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>Shuffle 开销</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{执行时间} \\approx \\frac{\\text{数据量}}{\\text{节点数} \\times \\text{单节点吞吐}} + \\text{Shuffle 开销}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">执行时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节点数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单节点吞吐</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数据量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Shuffle </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">开销</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Spark SQL 让数据分析师可以用 SQL 语法处理 PB 级数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession&#10;&#10;spark = SparkSession.builder.appName(&quot;digital_economy&quot;).getOrCreate()&#10;df = spark.read.parquet(&quot;hdfs:///data/transactions/&quot;)&#10;result = df.groupBy(&quot;region&quot;).agg({&quot;amount&quot;: &quot;sum&quot;, &quot;user_id&quot;: &quot;countDistinct&quot;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pyspark.sql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SparkSession.builder.appName(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"digital_economy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).getOrCreate()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spark.read.parquet(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hdfs:///data/transactions/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df.groupBy(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).agg({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"countDistinct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"数据湖与湖仓一体\">数据湖与湖仓一体</h3><p>2025-2026 年，数据湖仓（Lakehouse）架构成为主流。它结合数据湖的灵活性和数据仓库的治理能力，以 Delta Lake、Apache Iceberg 等表格式实现 ACID 事务和 Schema Evolution。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li>Apache Iceberg 成为多引擎数据湖的事实标准表格式，支持 Spark、Flink、Trino 等多引擎访问</li>\n<li>向量数据库（Milvus、Pinecone）因 AI 应用兴起，专为 Embedding 检索优化</li>\n<li>Serverless 数据仓库（BigQuery、Snowflake）降低了企业大数据分析的运维门槛</li>\n<li>实时数据仓库（Apache Doris、StarRocks）实现亚秒级 OLAP 查询</li>\n<li>Data Mesh 理念推动数据治理从中心化向领域自治演进</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>设计一个电商数据库的 ER 模型，包含用户、商品、订单和评价四个核心实体</li>\n<li>在本地搭建 Spark 单机环境，使用 PySpark 对 1GB CSV 数据进行分组聚合</li>\n<li>比较 MySQL 和 MongoDB 在存储商品详情（含不定数量的规格参数）时的优劣</li>\n<li>讨论：企业在选择数据存储方案时，应考虑哪些非技术因素（成本、团队技能、合规）？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据库与大数据平台是数字经济的基础设施层。从 SQL 到 NoSQL，从 Hadoop 到 Spark，再到湖仓一体架构，技术持续演进的方向是更快的查询速度、更低的运维复杂度和更强的数据治理能力。数字经济从业者需要根据业务场景和数据特征，做出合理的技术选型决策。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据库与大数据平台","id":"数据库与大数据平台"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"关系型数据库与 SQL","id":"关系型数据库与-sql"},{"level":3,"text":"索引与查询优化","id":"索引与查询优化"},{"level":3,"text":"NoSQL 数据库","id":"nosql-数据库"},{"level":3,"text":"Hadoop 生态系统","id":"hadoop-生态系统"},{"level":3,"text":"Apache Spark","id":"apache-spark"},{"level":3,"text":"数据湖与湖仓一体","id":"数据湖与湖仓一体"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据库与云计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/database-and-cloud-computing"},"next":{"title":"人工智能与机器学习导论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/digital-technology-foundations/ai-machine-learning-intro"}}